{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911230/extras/42ad6d57853b43ab9223a82030ebf995.poster.avif?t=1756533746\" aria-label=\"Keypress Mania Gameplay\" width=780 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911230/extras/42ad6d57853b43ab9223a82030ebf995.webm?t=1756533746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911230/extras/42ad6d57853b43ab9223a82030ebf995.mp4?t=1756533746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you see is what you type. Inspired by the classic typing game featuring a certain ocean predator, Keypress Mania lets you experience a typing craze like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911230/extras/85479a120ac41e93febfd75e5f842713.avif?t=1756533746\" alt=\"GAME MODES\" width=940 height=182 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLASSIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual game mode that introduces players to the typing game genre. This beginner-friendly mode gradually increases in difficulty, helping players build confidence and skill as they progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARCADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A more challenging game mode that introduces special word types and power cards. This time-based mode is designed for thrill-seeking players who want to sharpen their typing skills under pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time limit \u2014 just pure typing endurance. Type until it's game over, aim for high scores, and climb the leaderboards. Perfect for ambitious typing wizards chasing mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VERSUS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight to win! Compete against friends or random players in this game mode, crafted for competitive typing enthusiasts who thrive on challenge and rivalry.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own custom word spawner configuration and practice at your own pace. This flexible game mode is perfect for anyone \u2014 from beginners to seasoned typists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911230/extras/bf768e4e6478f628ad8706210dab173c.webp?t=1756533746\" width=940 height=20 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>OTHER FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THEMES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your game screen to match your style. Customizable elements include key tiles, background images, word boundary, and loading transitions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORD BANKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes word data for 12 different languages. Most entries are sourced from Scrabble word lists and cross-verified with dictionaries. For languages with extensive word sets, additional filtering was applied using frequency lists from the\u00a0OpenSubtitles dataset to ensure relevance and usability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911230/extras/06319eb5a3cc971ab1689cc70d1d3da4.avif?t=1756533746\" width=940 height=75 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3911230?t=1756533746","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911230/7eb787462dececceb4c431078fa590e10329edd1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756533746","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911230/463ad6532c9b5824fc8298a08b119647308d57f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756533746","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911230/463ad6532c9b5824fc8298a08b119647308d57f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756533746","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911230/extras/42ad6d57853b43ab9223a82030ebf995.poster.avif?t=1756533746\" aria-label=\"Keypress Mania Gameplay\" width=780 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911230/extras/42ad6d57853b43ab9223a82030ebf995.webm?t=1756533746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911230/extras/42ad6d57853b43ab9223a82030ebf995.mp4?t=1756533746\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you see is what you type. Inspired by the classic typing game featuring a certain ocean predator, Keypress Mania lets you experience a typing craze like never before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911230/extras/85479a120ac41e93febfd75e5f842713.avif?t=1756533746\" alt=\"GAME MODES\" width=940 height=182 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLASSIC</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual game mode that introduces players to the typing game genre. This beginner-friendly mode gradually increases in difficulty, helping players build confidence and skill as they progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ARCADE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A more challenging game mode that introduces special word types and power cards. This time-based mode is designed for thrill-seeking players who want to sharpen their typing skills under pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ENDLESS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time limit \u2014 just pure typing endurance. Type until it's game over, aim for high scores, and climb the leaderboards. Perfect for ambitious typing wizards chasing mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>VERSUS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight to win! Compete against friends or random players in this game mode, crafted for competitive typing enthusiasts who thrive on challenge and rivalry.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own custom word spawner configuration and practice at your own pace. This flexible game mode is perfect for anyone \u2014 from beginners to seasoned typists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911230/extras/bf768e4e6478f628ad8706210dab173c.webp?t=1756533746\" width=940 height=20 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>OTHER FEATURES</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THEMES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Personalize your game screen to match your style. Customizable elements include key tiles, background images, word boundary, and loading transitions.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORD BANKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes word data for 12 different languages. Most entries are sourced from Scrabble word lists and cross-verified with dictionaries. For languages with extensive word sets, additional filtering was applied using frequency lists from the\u00a0OpenSubtitles dataset to ensure relevance and usability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911230/extras/06319eb5a3cc971ab1689cc70d1d3da4.avif?t=1756533746\" width=940 height=75 /></span></p>","developers":["rey3.dev"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911230/fa5dd1305fc19855f03d0542229a6c79a5b4d39a/header.jpg?t=1756533746","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257184678,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184678/movie480.mp4?t=1755747255","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184678/movie_max.mp4?t=1755747255"},"name":"KeypressMania - Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257184678/73573289d16dcc59ac45d03fba61b630e824a8f6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755747255","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184678/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755747255","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257184678/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755747255"}}],"name":"Keypress Mania","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 5th Gen i